    "current_example": {
      "math_academy_id": "e-7793",
      "problem": "The point $P$ below is rotated by $45^\\circ$ counterclockwise around the origin and then reflected across the $x$-axis. Which of the given points is the image of $P$ under this sequence of transformations?\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14223522/assets/eb4416a7d6a0d131ad6b535571001b61a50152c59459bf125f42dff2788411cd.png)",
      "worked_solution": "Let's apply the given transformations.\n\n- Rotating the point $P$ by $45^\\circ$ counterclockwise around the origin gives the point $A,$ as shown below:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14223522/assets/53128ffb3404a6fb27b096896f744b57e143ec2c5d630ae7ef9d80c256bfb43c.png)\n\n- Reflecting the point $A$ in the $x$-axis gives the point $D,$ as shown below:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14223522/assets/234d8273aea8cfc59810b44f575887de0effe09d7ab95657b4d8b76baf822a04.png)\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is $D.$",
